# vhs tape for the README demo GIF. Regenerate from the repo root:
#   vhs demo/demo.tape
# Answers come from demo/bin/claude, a shim replaying real captured
# ai-shell output, so the recording is quick and deterministic.

Output demo/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 745
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "source demo/setup.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms

Type "howto fetch main while on this branch"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.2s

Type "askf what does main:main mean"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4.2s

Type "wtf is a symlink"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.6s

Type "howtoc tarball this directory excluding .git"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.6s
Type "# ^ already on the clipboard"
Sleep 1.6s
Enter

Type "ask-set-model"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s

Type "ask-set-model opus high"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s

Type "ask what is the meaning of life, the universe and everything"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.4s

Type `askf "are you sure?"`
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "ask delete root"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.6s

Sleep 2s
